<title>BELGIUM: Creyf's soars at start of capital increase.</title>
<headline>Creyf's soars at start of capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Belgian temporary employment agency Creyf's NV, helped by a clutch of buy recommendations, surged on Thursday on the first day of the company's capital increase.</p>
<p>Creyf's rose 135 francs, or 6.6 percent, to 2,185 francs, a new record closing high.</p>
<p>Creyf's is offering 265,298 new shares at 1,725 francs each. One new share can be subscribed to for every four presently held. The offer is due to close on October 24.</p>
<p>The capital increase is to pay for the recent acquisition of Dutch employment agency  Forester BV.</p>
